{"c":[{"id":"3f064eaca2fcf0fefa6bbcc1fb5059a4c35fb2c8f2fe25a4f8066c39fadf72e5","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line (dated leaves, prefixed packs); recall matches text and captions; walkers enqueue NapChild ids from the tree; fold_request adds --path REL when walk-up would miss; 3.11 floor is right after import sys; named_ids catches _TREE_PARSE_ERRORS.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"f47ceea4c51ec6383ddeaae45ef7b734211a1b1b572530596b6750c6578d16ee","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share xN TOKEN: body; leaves are x1 YYYY-MM-DD: no parens; packs have no day; recall matches note text and captions; fold_request Run: adds --path REL when walk-up from $PWD would miss the store.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"15146632137cf43021d489f9e4f48ee9b6d6e2a642322ff1169f9cb7034287ee","sum":"fold_request Run: adds --path REL when walk-up from $PWD would miss the store; wake dates leaves x1 YYYY-MM-DD: from the stamp, packs stay xN prefix: caption.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260823T212302Z-619f7114a3c3445b","text":"fold_request Run: includes --path REL when walk-up from $PWD would not select the folded store.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T142559Z-853c6c0b6ec510e9","text":"Wake leaf lines are x1 (YYYY-MM-DD): text from the filename stamp; nap lines stay xN prefix: caption with no day.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"87f86d77a75e48416070f802db542dbcccc25c89d62f37f501be26d054792939","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share xN TOKEN: body; leaves are x1 YYYY-MM-DD: with no parens; recall matches note text and nap captions, not grain, day, or id prefix.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T143849Z-bb7956f2f4651e25","text":"Wake leaf line is x1 YYYY-MM-DD: text, no parens; same xN TOKEN: body grammar as a pack.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T163806Z-5d0f4e137b683d7f","text":"Zoom and recall print the same wake grammar as wake (dated leaves, unique-prefix packs); recall matches note text and nap captions, not grain, day, or id prefix.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"9f77cab1df115c25d8e0746a384deb1be0e3f36eac8973662b5f6e162a1312f1","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line and enqueue NapChild ids from the tree; 3.11 floor is immediately after import sys; named_ids catches _TREE_PARSE_ERRORS including AttributeError; agent-display-unify is PR #37.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"38ea7198a36885685cc2ea905e2a543f4ae276b8b1741dd00430fea553a10713","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line; proof walkers enqueue NapChild ids from the children tree, not zoom stdout; agent-display-unify archived as PR #37.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T165407Z-a27fb3a92805a5d6","text":"Recall and zoom print format_wake_line like wake; proof walkers enqueue NapChild ids from the children tree, not zoom stdout tokens.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T173019Z-27bced2c4e108fab","text":"agent-display-unify archived: wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line; PR #37 on labelling.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1fcbcf0346304c1f1707b91c5dfef6a1949cb0638783cfa2e283e8e02afca8f9","sum":"3.11 floor is immediately after import sys so 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer; named_ids catches _TREE_PARSE_ERRORS including AttributeError on a non-mapping child.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T174425Z-833402129b2e4377","text":"require_python in main() is too late: module-level import tomllib dies on Python 3.10 before SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T174736Z-d428af9e8413115e","text":"named_ids catches _TREE_PARSE_ERRORS like the other tree readers, including AttributeError when a children-file child is not a mapping.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"58d640914b470b3e788fc8223f8626dcf0759a72c38077ba5e07c1e1dc825271","sum":"Root wake prints how_to under Usage and catalogs other stores; skip a second root wake when that Usage block is still readable. Onboarding is init (bootstrap only); 3.11 floor is right after import sys.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"5672e8d92ee69a50307052bb4e51117b8b5e5f4bca68181bebb78714bc7c4975","sum":"equal_grain_pair is fold-test only; 3.11 floor is right after import sys (#42). Root wake prints how_to_text under Usage; AGENTS.md is bootstrap only.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"61fbb8f64668e9b17ced31ae970f6ec0243d8c957831ea7327bca1389c9e6fe6","sum":"equal_grain_pair is a fold-test oracle only; fold_request walks adjacent same-grain ViewNodes itself; sys.version_info is immediately after import sys so 3.10 prints the floor message instead of ModuleNotFoundError.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T174900Z-adbb0c6c6a991bca","text":"equal_grain_pair is a fold-test oracle only; the copied driver does not keep it. fold_request still walks adjacent same-grain ViewNodes itself.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T174934Z-b3f3d92f255bc910","text":"summem checks sys.version_info immediately after import sys and before import tomllib; Python 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer instead of ModuleNotFoundError.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"9f3b2086879920a2ae41118c93866581f48ad4193b14fd63236911f2101ff135","sum":"3.11 floor is import-time before tomllib (#42/#38). Root wake prints how_to_text under Usage; AGENTS.md is bootstrap only (wake-if-needed, note, writer-only).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T175246Z-a3c8d06b34d1a7c4","text":"PR #42 feat/require-python closes #38: import-time 3.11 floor before tomllib; Python 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T003315Z-1061fd623922ceb6","text":"Root wake prints how_to_text under == SumMem Usage ==; the AGENTS.md prefix is the bootstrap only (wake-if-needed, note, writer-only).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"dcff76f4cde304afbbad7ee166bc0b4b29bab7abe8bded3e6f7647d98de8885b","sum":"Skip a root wake only when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable. Onboarding is init: prints the bootstrap (prompt_text()), writes nothing; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once. A consumer upgrade is copying the script. Root-wake catalog tests slice that section.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"961801789374c2175c3449024d4fab62e04ebf2e22a4f4651bd527456bad1a3d","sum":"Skip a root wake only when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable. A consumer upgrade is copying the script; init prints the bootstrap and writes nothing; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T003337Z-7415cd62d790d57b","text":"Skip a root wake when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable; do not skip on a remembered wake or the footer alone.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T003343Z-32520d7e11eb7ac8","text":"A consumer upgrade is copying the script; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once. init prints the bootstrap and writes nothing.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"d0629b8c4f7d147aaabb8e74c1becbbbe8f9af17d5d6ebf5ec3656bde51f28fe","sum":"Onboarding is init (prompt_text()); root-wake catalog tests slice the catalog section.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T004057Z-33f2fad52281ba51","text":"Root-wake tests that pin catalog shape must slice the catalog section; Usage contains .summem/summem and wake --path.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T133725Z-1b75d9fa0073870a","text":"Onboarding is summem init (prompt_text()); there is no docs/agents-prompt.md copy.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
